# text = There are 79,000 unfit homes in the north - east , 257,000 in the north - west , 160,000 in Yorkshire and Humberside , 116,000 in the east midlands , 200,000 in the west midlands , 114,000 in the south - west , 149,000 in the south - east — excluding London , and more than 240,000 in London .
