# text = The overall effect would be to limit the range of persons within the exclusion to those not on benefit and pensioners who work for up to 20 hours a week and to increase the weekly remuneration that they could receive to 10 times the national minimum wage — over and above reasonable day - to - day subsistence and accommodation .
