# text_id = 1606
# text = The Conservatives say that they are running the economy well — I do not want to take my hon . Friend too far down that road — but I remind him that the botch - up that they caused through the poll tax has cost taxpayers £ 14 billion and that black Wednesday cost them nearly £ 4 billion .
