# text = Nevertheless , in the majority of such cases , the costs of carrying out flood defence will be comfortably outweighed by the resulting benefits , but in cases where the costs of a proposed scheme are in excess of the benefits that would accrue , the investment of public money cannot be justified unless there is imminent risk to life .
