# text_id = 1629
# text = The Government recognise that there are concerns that the current system for handling some major , complex fraud trials is not working satisfactorily and that there may be a case for considering some change to the system , but we have not yet reached a conclusion on whether the ending of jury trials in serious fraud cases is desirable in principle .
