# text = My understanding — we have now jumped to Clause 7 — is that the Bill contains provisions , to which the noble Lord , Lord Molyneaux , refers , stating that the police authority shall have the responsibility of ascertaining the views of the public about matters concerning policing , and of gaining the co-operation of the public in preventing crime .
