# text = The hon . Gentleman should recall that , right at the start of the consultation process , no strong lobby argued that we should continue the existing system , because , as my hon . Friend the Member for Monmouth ( Mr. Evans ) said , there are savings to be achieved by having one unitary local authority administering services .
