# text_id = 1675
# text = However , the hon . Member for Kincardine and Deeside ( Mr. Kynoch ) has given it support and caused great offence in my constituency , given that in the Standing Committee he was able to make a case — with cross-party support — on grounds of public opinion for the adjustment of boundaries that immediately concern his constituency .
