# text_id = 1677
# text = Although I understand the need for unity among the allies and NATO , I reiterate the point made during a previous statement on Kosovo by the right hon . Member for Chesterfield ( Mr. Benn ) that the use of German troops would be at best insensitive and at worst highly provocative , and might jeopardise a fragile peace .
