# text_id = 1680
# text = It is my fear that if the increases are allowed to go ahead , even at the levels that are being contemplated over the next year , a number of businesses will become bankrupt during that year — businesses that would have found their rates reduced by the revaluation had they survived as long as the beginning of next year .
