# text_id = 1699
# text = So it is impossible ever to guarantee that there will be no surcharges unless we are prepared to say to the tour operators , " You build in whatever you like to cover yourself for this " , and then there will be no surcharge ; but most of us would be paying much too much to have that already covered .
