# text = In 1994/95 , 17.5 per cent . of new lettings of council homes were made to homeless households in priority need ; 40 per cent . were to other households on the waiting list ; 41 per cent . were to existing council tenants transferring to other council housing ( including those transferring by mutual exchange ) and 1.5 per cent .
