# text_id = 1721
# text = Looking ahead to Amendment No. 5 , tabled in the name of the noble Baroness , Lady Young , I should say that I am concerned to see again the suggestion that this role — which I believe the agency under its new chairman , Professor Clive Booth , has fulfilled so well — should be transferred immediately to the GTC .
