# text_id = 1728
# text = Even without invoking anything quite as extreme as Oban , I still think that , as a parent , when a child comes rather tired out of school late on a Friday afternoon , and with Friday trains stopping earlier and earlier each year , I should hesitate to encourage him to go on a very long journey that night .
