# text = I do not propose to dwell on the broader issue of the desirability of EMU , and indeed beyond that , as was touched upon by a number of your Lordships , including the noble Lord , Lord Beloff , perhaps the inevitability of moving eventually to something like a federal structure and comparing that with the United States .
