# text_id = 1741
# text = The petition prays that the House , which is committed to upholding respect for human life and protection of the weak and vulnerable , will do everything possible to prevent the distribution and use of Mifegyne ( known as RU486 ) and any other drugs which , like it , are produced with the deliberate intention of destroying innocent human life .
