# text_id = 1744
# text = Speaking as the father of a 12 year - old girl than whom nothing and no - one is more precious in life to me , I must say to the noble Lord that I believe that he is wrong in thinking that the Bill will do anything to prevent future tragedies of that kind or the future deaths of children .
