# text_id = 1745
# text = Between 1983 and 1992 , the Committee produced some excellent reports on " green " issues , but during that time it never examined local government finance — for instance , the whole question of the poll tax — or housing , because its then Chairman felt that on such controversial matters the Select Committee would not work particularly well .
