# text = The phrase at any time is important because the whole point of the safeguards that we seek to introduce is that those with the responsibility under the existing statute , amended by this Bill if it is enacted , must be aware that , at any time , others with the interests of the patient at heart can step in and exercise the powers to be given in the amendment .
