# text_id = 1778
# text = There is a history of under - investment to explain the loss of the trade in earlier years , but now I am told that our yards are as high - tech as any in the world , so I wonder whether my right hon . Friend would consider commissioning a study of what our yards need to do to get back a decent share of the world trade in shipbuilding .
