# text_id = 1782
# text = This morning I take great pleasure in supporting my hon . Friend whose Bill gives us the opportunity to help people such as John , who lost his brother in the war , who has spent his life in and out of institutions , who has now lost the parents who loved him dearly and who , at 70 years old , deserves all the help that we can give him .
