# text_id = 1784
# text = Individuals may refer to the Clerk informally by some other title , but it is important that in formal proceedings and in other formal dealings involving the Clerk , the office should be referred to in a clear and consistent way , which does not confuse the office with any other office or position and which ensures that everyone , not least the Clerk himself , knows where they stand .
