# text_id = 1788
# text = How can the hon . Gentleman allow himself to slight that approach — especially as he will , I am sure , have heard what my right hon . Friend the Chancellor of the Duchy of Lancaster said about our agreement with the Treasury that all savings from market testing will be retained by the Departments concerned and will be ploughed back into the services they provide to the public ?
