# text = In addition , the proposals are that storage payments on what is known as C sugar should be discontinued ; that preferential imports of raw cane sugar to Community refineries should be guaranteed ; and , lastly , that national aids to the beet sector in Spain , Germany and north Italy should be phased out while allowing a 50 per cent . reduction only for the rest of Italy .
