# text_id = 1792
# text = While I appreciate that this Government cannot be expected to remedy these inequalities at a stroke , perhaps I may urge upon them the need to launch without delay an educational campaign to ensure that the people of this country recognise the case for a fairer distribution of income , and the need to repudiate the absurd disclaimer that they are not in favour of a policy of tax and spend .
