# text_id = 1793
# text = We have a right to say that , if such a major project is to go ahead , we should not — as the hon . Member for West Bromwich , East ( Mr. Snape ) said earlier — settle for whatever is on the table , but should ensure that it is the right project and that the correct amount of money and no more should be spent on it .
