# text = The harsh reality — this is where I differ with the hon . Member for Spelthorne — is that a voluntary decision means a decision taken by those who speak on behalf of the IRA , the Ulster Volunteer Force , the Ulster Defence Association , the Ulster Freedom Fighters , the Red Hand commandos or whoever they all may be , to give up , destroy or decommission their weapons .
