# text_id = 1798
# text = As for the question raised by my hon . Friend the Member for Greenock and Inverclyde ( Dr. Godman ) about whether the new full arrangements to be rolled out from 1 April would apply to the whole of the United Kingdom , or whether the use of vouchers would be abandoned in Scotland , the answer is that they will apply to the whole of the United Kingdom .
