# text_id = 1799
# text = I remind the House that the need to relate economic and trading relationships with political and social relationships was identified about eight years ago by a far - sighted Head of Government of the European Community , who said that what was needed was " a series of new policies to promote the economic , social and political growth " on which the future well - being of the Community depended .
