# text = I am glad to respond to the debate , in which we have heard speeches by the hon . Members for Glasgow , Maryhill ( Mrs. Fyfe ) , for Paisley , South ( Mr. McMaster ) , for Strathkelvin and Bearsden ( Mr. Galbraith ) and for Orkney and Shetland ( Mr. Wallace ) , all of whom have highlighted the dramatic flooding last winter in the Clyde area .
