# text_id = 1801
# text = I was saying how many people it could help and how long it could run the health service , for example , which employs 1 million people ; but given that the entire population of Scotland over the age of 16 numbers just over 4 million and the economically active population is only 2.5 million , it seems an extraordinarily large sum to spend on such a small work force .
