# text_id = 1802
# text = From 1st January LEAs and governing bodies will be able to award an incremental enhancement of up to £ 999 to any classroom teacher below the top of the scale , provided that the value of the next incremental point is not exceeded ; and LEAs will be able to put in place local extensions to the standard scale and thereby raise the top point from £ 16,000 to £ 18,000 .
