# text_id = 1803
# text = In order for the national targets required by the Bill to be firmly based , in order to take account of the diversity and variety that the Minister pointed out so eloquently in Committee and in order to recognise the important role to be played by the Scottish Parliament and Welsh assembly , my amendment suggests that those bodies must be involved as an integral part of the process .
