# text_id = 1804
# text = The current regulations are quintessentially archaic , as they treat the woman — the surviving spouse is usually a woman , but could be either gender — as a chattel and as someone who is dependent on their relationship with a partner , rather than as an independent person who has contributed equally to a partnership that has ended in the most tragic circumstances , in a death in service .
