# text_id = 1805
# text = It is extraordinary that , despite all the clear evidence that improvements to the rescue operation are needed , despite what Hayes has said and despite the fact that more people died once they were in the water than died because they were trapped in the boat when it sank , the Government immediately responded negatively to the request for an early review of the rescue arrangements and equipment .
