# text_id = 1806
# text = It would not be particularly rewarding to reflect on how or why the Ravenscraig problems developed — whether the cause was the original decision of the Conservative Government to encourage the industry to locate the mill at Ravenscraig , the decision to split the effort between Scotland and Wales , the location 40 miles from the sea , the separation from the cold strip mill or the loss of Linwood .
