# text_id = 1807
# text = Entrepreneurs would continue to be able to hold car boot sales , sellers would be able to sell their goods and buyers would be able to browse in search of bargains , but we would pay more regard to people who live in rural districts — the people who have to put up with the inconvenience that is caused when , Sunday after Sunday , cars invade rural areas without controls .
