# text_id = 1813
# text = Finally , I very much regret that a Labour Government — a Labour Government ! — should bring forward this spiteful piece of legislation , which will not guarantee that there are no future Dunblanes , which will deprive innocent people of their legitimate sport , while demonising and punishing them for an act by a criminal madman , and will leave thousands of handguns in the possession of crooks .
