# text = Since it was established in 1975 , it has opened 42 new railway stations , its subsidies have halved rail fares for people in the region , it provides 3,400 park - and - ride spaces at stations in the region and , as a passenger transport executive , it has access to substantial funding for the development of passenger transport services under section 56 of the 1968 Transport Act .
