# text_id = 1824
# text = The new clause creates an offence for a wholesaler , his employee or agent to barter , sell , expose or offer for sale alcoholic liquor unless he does so from premises exclusively used for wholesale trading or from licensed premises , a licensed canteen or a registered club during the hours when it is lawful to sell alcohol by retail in these premises , that canteen or club .
