# text = Finally , before sitting down , I should like to pay tribute to the noble Lord , Lord Kennet , and to his noble friend the noble Lord , Lord Jenkins of Putney , who is unfortunately not in his place this afternoon , as they both regularly raise issues and test the validity of policies that many of us would otherwise be tempted to accept without sufficient review .
