# text_id = 1830
# text = I said that the city of York was calling for an extension to the outer ring road , which had the general consent of the people of York , but to go beyond that into rural areas , from a population density of 350 people per 10 hectares down to 10 people per 10 hectares , would produce additional costs to provide the same level of service for smaller communities .
