# text = Although the Conservative party is the party of freedom , free expression and freedom of trade — it is also the party of freedom from high taxes , which may explain the point made by the hon . Member for Hornsey and Wood Green ( Mrs. Roche ) — it has always been the party of freedom under the law , and that is pertinent to the new clause .
