# text_id = 1835
# text = Will the Minister accept that we cannot be confident that the IRA will decommission its illegally held arms and explosives when , only last week , the Irish police arrested two terrorists in Donegal who were carrying explosives for bombing in Northern Ireland , who both wore Sinn Fein green ribbons when they appeared in court and who have both been admitted into the Provisional IRA wing of Portlaoise prison ?
