# text_id = 1836
# text = On the one day of the year that we have such a debate , we should at least be able to expect that the Treasury Minister present would have the courtesy to put up with those of us who attended every meeting of the PAC throughout the year to produce reports — which then receive disdainful replies in the form of Treasury minutes , as I hope to demonstrate .
