# text_id = 1837
# text = Those 700,000 — a very large number of small employers , because the definition that we chose is generous — will have not merely the regular advantages of the national insurance contributions set against an average expectation of having to pay some SSP ; they will have the safeguard that , if any employee is sick for more than six weeks , they will go back to 100 per cent .
