# text = My Lords , it is customary but by no means merely as a matter of form that we take the opportunity , when a consolidation Bill is about to be passed in your Lordships ' House , to be polite enough to accord thanks to parliamentary counsel , to the Law Commission and to the Joint Committee of your Lordships ' House and another place which deals with consolidation Bills .
