# text_id = 1841
# text = I am glad to acknowledge that I know a few lawyers whose ability to grasp the essential nature of scientific discourse astonishes me as much as my ignorance of matters legal must dismay them — the noble and learned Lord the Lord Chancellor is one of the most outstanding — but the evidence presented to the sub - committee leads me to suppose that they must comprise a very small minority .
