# text_id = 1847
# text = My hon . Friend will remember that , before the agency began its work , I spoke to him and to many other colleagues in the House and warned them that although the expectation would be resistance from and difficulties for women when the agency was introduced , in fact the reaction would come from men who were reluctant to pay in full the costs of maintaining their children .
