# text_id = 1848
# text = One of my conclusions from the events of the past four weeks is that , if the Anglo - Saxons are unwise enough to go to war without at least 90 per cent . of the support that they have had for the blockade , and if the disaster that I fear follows , they will not be able to claim that they did not know that the gun was loaded .
