# text_id = 1852
# text = Finally , I am deeply concerned , as I am sure that most noble Lords are , that , while Mr. Alan Langlands , the top person in the National Health Service , has stated that Mr. McLean will not be offered a contract because of his conduct in this area , there is no mechanism to prevent him obtaining a contract from a national health trust in another area .
