# text_id = 1853
# text = My Lords , without being in the least complacent about the individual difficulty that inspired the original Question , does the Minister accept that many of us underwrite the words of the noble Lord , Lord Boyd - Carpenter , and pay tribute both to the British Airports Authority and to the individual controllers at the other airports in Britain who are contributing enormously to the economy of this country ?
