# text_id = 1857
# text = I say in passing to the noble Lord who is enjoying a little scoff on the sidelines on the Front Bench of the Liberal Party that he does a great disservice to the many people appointed to authorities up and down this land who perform magnificently and independently , even though , from time to time , their appointee is the Secretary of State or a Secretary of State .
