# text = With regard to my own constituency , however , I know that because of major problems in the amount of feedback and guidance that magistrates courts are given , the policy of the court in Blackburn — and , I suspect , also in Oldham — is not really a policy , but the way in which the court has behaved traditionally , without any rational scrutiny of that behaviour .
