# text = I do not quarrel with the Lord Chancellor 's conclusion , but I hope that he would not quarrel with my observation that the scale of the consultation was limited and that , judging by the parliamentary answer given by the then Minister of State , Lord Chancellor 's Department on 2 March , those who were consulted did not include the users of notarial services in my constituency .
