# text_id = 1862
# text = There could be traffic across the river , but apart from the Ford ferry which transports workers from Belvedere to Dagenham , there is only the Woolwich ferry — the floating link between the north and south circular roads in which the Department of Transport has failed to invest and which it has neglected to modernise , resulting in queues and congestion as boats are taken out of service .
