# text_id = 1867
# text = Because of commitments which have already been made in respect of the membership of the national park boards being established under the Local Government ( Wales ) Act 1994 and the circular letters which had already been issued for consultations about establishing Welsh national park authorities , the Secretary of State for Wales proposes to leave unchanged the provisions for membership of the national park authorities as they apply to Wales .
