# text_id = 1872
# text = I am simply saying that , if we are considering allowing the Bill to become law , and if it affects pig and chicken farmers in my constituency and elsewhere in England — I am certain that it will , because of the constraints involving the clearing up of dung — we should surely consider whether the same provisions will apply to the overseas farmers with whom we are competing .
