# text = I must start by congratulating my hon . Friend the Minister of State , Northern Ireland Office , and his colleagues on the degree with which they have listened to representations made to them by hon . Members on both sides of the House and by many parties in Northern Ireland , and for the careful consideration that they have given those representations , some of which appear in the Bill .
