# text = Further , new recruits in their arduous and ever - increasing duties , as spelt out both in Front Line First and in the 1994 Defence Estimates , will obtain support and help from their families and friends because through the regimental system — there may well be a family tradition of serving in the Royal Navy or in the Royal Air Force — they will know what to expect .
