# text_id = 1876
# text = Does my right hon . Friend accept that Labour Members representing Derbyshire constituencies look forward to the opportunity on Tuesday to promote our beautiful county , welcome the opportunity to discuss the council 's successes in view of the Conservatives ' intransigence towards our county over the past 18 years and are pleased that the Government have recognised our financial difficulties and allowed us to raise the spending limits ?
