# text = The noble Lords would like to make it a requirement on the face of the Bill that , in the case of those grant - maintained schools which they term " endowed schools " , the Secretary of State would have to consult with the Church of England Board of Education and the Catholic Education Service and such other bodies as appear appropriate before making regulations under Clause 53 .
