# text = As I sought to indicate , the use of temporary judges — which I understood the party opposite agreed in principle was not a bad idea — is to deal with what are difficulties which occur from time to time through illness or unavailability of permanent judges and what are from time to time undoubtedly , as the noble Lord will be aware , surges in business beyond immediate prediction .
