# text = I think that it would have been much better if the hon . Gentleman had introduced a Bill that sought to being to an end the legislation that provides that people can vote at 18 and die for their country at 18 but cannot sit in this place to decide whether there should be an Act of war , which would lead to the death of young men and women .
