# text_id = 1892
# text = If we fail , through our own lack of initiative , to maintain a vibrant Hong Kong , we may be sure that both Hong Kong 's and China 's , memories will be long and British businessmen in the next century will have to pay , in terms of lost profit opportunities , for a lack for foresight on our part today in maintaining the wellbeing of Hong Kong .
