# text_id = 1895
# text = If he thinks that his case is such a good one , he should have confidence in the ballot box in Broadgreen and Coventry , or anywhere else where the poll tax has been fought , and put those ideas before the British electorate , not use bureaucratic measures to try to exclude from the House those who have taken a stand and gone to prison on a matter of principle .
