# text_id = 1896
# text = I do not intend to protract my comments , but , as an exercise in democracy , I am happy to tell the Minister that our surveys had four pages of questions — I concede that they were not all answered — and that that produced 5,000 or 6,000 answers , so I still think that the Government could have done a bit better in relation to responses from Londoners .
