# text_id = 1897
# text = It is most unlikely that the ITC would want to create a Channel 3 region smaller than the whole of Wales because it would almost certainly not be economically viable , and it is most improbable that the ITC would wish to split Wales between two larger regions unless it considered that such an approach would be likely to be the only way to provide a viable service for Wales .
