# text = I have a procedural question , which is whether arrangements will be made for the tribunal to ensure that there is in the papers a box to tick , or some other way to enter the fact that a penalty notice has been served , so that the tribunal may look at both automatically and simultaneously , rather than finding out by accident that a penalty notice has been served .
