# text_id = 1901
# text = In the absence of a cure — and it is important to note that there is as yet no cure , and that in spite of the intensive scientific effort devoted to the matter , there seems no likelihood of the development of a cure in the near future — the only weapon available to us in our efforts to curb the spread of the disease is awareness and improved lifestyles .
