# text_id = 1903
# text = It is one of those nice ironies of parliamentary life that I follow the hon . Member for Derbyshire , South ( Mrs. Currie ) , because in due course I shall be leaving the European Parliament to concentrate on my work in the House , whereas I understand that the hon . Lady is about to abandon her constituents for the prospect of a seat in the European Parliament .
