# text_id = 1904
# text = Does the right hon . Gentleman accept that it is not the toughness of the inflation target that is most important , but the toughness of the action taken to achieve it , and that in many ways my right hon . Friend the Chancellor has already shown his willingness to take tough action , particularly through the independence that he has given the Bank of England in monetary matters ?
