# text_id = 1906
# text = Lastly , the new agenda of British politics in the next 15 years of Conservative Government will be to complete , of course , a number of those things that we have started , such as the privatisation programme , but also to begin a whole process of trying , just as we have given ownership to the British people , to persuade the British people to take more responsibility .
