# text_id = 1907
# text = Nothing in this Order shall — ( a ) prevent any proceedings to which the Order applies from being taken or completed earlier than is required by the Order ; or ( b ) prevent any business ( whether on the Bill or not ) from being proceeded with on any day after the completion of all such proceedings on the Bill as are to be taken on that day .
