# text_id = 1909
# text = In fairness , I must add that my opposition to the European system of central bank proposals in the Maastricht treaty is based , not simply on the fact that the bankers support them , but on my genuine belief that economic and monetary union will have the biggest impact of any of the proposals in the treaty , and will inflict serious damage on the economies of Europe .
