# text_id = 1913
# text = If we took ourselves back to 1979 and asked an unsuspecting public whether a Government who were spending what is now being spent on social security , and who had a record of increases such as that which we have witnessed since 1979 , were Labour or Tory , they would say that the Government must be Labour because only Labour would spend so much money on social security .
