# text = I am concerned to see that we have an opportunity this afternoon to explain to a wider audience , as well as to the sponsors of the Bill , our concerns about the speed with which the costs that will be inherent in the Bill , if it reaches the statute book in its present form , could be placed on employers and providers of various facilities for disabled people .
