# text = That being so , if the Maastricht treaty is ratified , will not a time come — perhaps not too long afterwards — when the European Court of Justice may be asked to decide on cases brought by employees in the United Kingdom , who will argue that , if other countries have the social chapter , there is no reason why people in this country should not benefit from it ?
