# text = I have told my constituents that , first and foremost , it is important to consider the issue on national defence grounds , but it is right for my constituents to ask whether , in an era of glasnost and when tensions are lessening , we need this radar cover , whether it must be provided like this and whether there are other places where it can be provided .
