# text = I hope that the hon . Gentleman will forgive me , but , in discharging the responsibilities I have for the protection of the people of this country , I am more inclined to take advice on the necessity for these powers from the police , the Security Service and the independent reviewer who has been appointed to inquire into these matters than I am from the hon . Gentleman .
