# text_id = 1923
# text = I hope that , if nothing else , our report has shown us all that the Commonwealth is not some nice , sentimental , ancient concept , but that it has a future and that it can go into the 21st century , as long as the British Government , British people and British Members of Parliament support it in the practical and sensible ways that we suggest in our report .
