# text_id = 1924
# text = I understand that Ministers care — Baroness Chalker has a tremendous track record on this , so it would be wrong to make such an allegation — but the cumulative effect of individual decisions made in a PESC round , perhaps to give a tax cut here or offer some alternative there , impact on emerging countries , whose younger generation look to Britain to provide and service their educational emancipation .
