# text_id = 1925
# text = In practice , the Government do not go bankrupt any more than local authorities , the creations of statute , do , so it follows that , in the final analysis , the judgment is about whether we want to afford a specific treatment or whether we prefer resources to be directed to the provision of an alternative treatment for the same condition or for an entirely different one .
