# text = I beg to move , That this House pays tribute to the role that GP fundholders have played in kick - starting and developing innovative practice in both primary care and the acute sector ; welcomes the advances that fundholding has brought to many patients ; accepts that fundholding has acted as a lever to improve services ; and consequently remains committed to the further development of GP fundholding .
