# text = I think that 70 per cent . of jobs in the Army are now open to women , 75 per cent . in the Royal Navy and 96 per cent . in the Royal Air Force . If we are to inspire a new generation of young women to take up the opportunity to serve their country , we must surely recognise the contribution of their grandmothers all those years ago .
