# text_id = 1939
# text = When will he educate his hon . Friends about the huge hidden subsidies that pour into the south - east of England and , more directly , about the fact that , over the past 16 years , the Government have been bankrolled by Scottish resources to the tune of £ 100,000 million of oil revenues , or £ 20,000 per head for every man , woman and child in Scotland ?
