# text = It can not be a purpose of Home Office policy — I have no reason to believe that the Home Office has departed from its policy because the then Home Secretary , the right hon . and learned Member for Rushcliffe , decided to stand on his head — that a person deemed by a court to be suitable for fining should end up in gaol at public expense .
