# text_id = 1943
# text = I do not know how many pit bull terriers had been imported into the country in the intervening six years after he opened the gates in 1977 , but I doubt whether it was many , and I doubt whether there was anything like the evidence that there is today to show that there is a particular threat that must be dealt with urgently , as this Bill seeks to do .
