# text_id = 1944
# text = I am analysing the diversion to which we have been subjected for the past couple of hours because , with one or two notable exceptions , the Opposition — as they usually do in social security debates — are seeking to divert attention from the fundamentally beneficial effects on the structure of the national insurance contributions scheme for employees and employers that the Government seek to introduce from April next year .
