# text_id = 1945
# text = We have to ask ourselves some serious questions if we , as part of the civilised world and as a civilising influence on the world , are unable to sit down at the table and help to produce an agreement that protects the environment , supports decent labour standards for people in other countries and improves animal welfare standards , while simultaneously promoting prosperity and enhancing worldwide trade arrangements .
