# text = Comparing 1992 with 1989 , the spawning stock of North sea cod was down by 30 per cent . , that of North sea haddock was down by 12 per cent . , that of west of Scotland cod was down by 14 per cent . , that of Irish sea cod was down 32 per cent . , and that of Celtic sea cod down by 65 per cent .
