# text = Would it not be timely — as the Opposition have recommended — for the Government to appoint a commission to make an independent assessment of the road and rail transport corridor infrastructure needs of Britain covering the next two decades with the aim of procuring rapid access to the new Europe and thereby averting in future the chaotic situation and the transport mess which have arisen under this Government ?
