# text = We are at some risk of repeating that flawed approach in precipitate judgments to the effect that air power on its own succeeded in this case , and that it will provide a universally valid approach in future conflicts in which NATO countries , with proper regard for the sensibilities of their citizens , expose their forces to no more risk than bombing from , say , 15,000 ft .
