# text_id = 1954
# text = The part of the new clause that deals with associated fund - raising bodies refers to a body " the profits of which are applied wholly for the purposes of a charity " , but it does not say that the body must be wholly owned by that charity , or that there may not be other subsidiary associated bodies that are not necessarily remitting all their profits to the charity .
