# text = To take a scenario to illustrate the need for the preparedness that we have at present , in the event of an Iraqi advance by tanks and infantry there would be a need not only to respond to the ground offensive but to ensure that the necessary Iraqi air cover is eliminated , both by interception and by attacks on their bases , thus denying their future back - up .
