# text = While I must declare an obvious interest in this matter as the chairman and chief executive of a company with major Hong Kong and British interests , I would most strongly urge my noble friends to identify a means , either within the legislation or outside it , to accord to British companies the same degree of support as other governments are giving to their companies with operations in Hong Kong .
