# text = My Lords , does my noble and learned friend share the concerns reportedly expressed by the noble and learned Lord , Lord Woolf , and by Sir Richard Scott that the court fees are so high with regard to small claims made by claimants that they may be deterred from using the scheme which my noble and learned friend himself has increased in importance by raising the limit to £ 5,000 ?
