# text_id = 1964
# text = In order to bring a sense of proportion to the hypochondriacal hysteria of the Opposition , will my right hon . Friend consider publishing a list of the comparable risks in our society , based on statistical evidence , which would probably show that one is as likely to win the jackpot in the lottery and one has a much greater chance of being murdered than of dying from this disease ?
