# text = This is extremely important as the Labour Party Office prior to the election were promising those in integral junior departments that their places would be honoured through to the age of 18 , the basis on which they were offered in the first place , whilst those in the free standing preparatory schools would have their place honoured to the end of that school , either 11 or 13 .
